                                "sense_id": "394a40ae-b98f-31bd-b436-819d39c549aa",
                                "text": "There has also been a drive to introduce clockface timetables with a higher frequency, with the dual aim of creating passenger familiarity with departure times at individual stations and of simplifying traincrew diagrams to produce better productivity."
